<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NewStreet Roleplay</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0b0f19;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Effet de lueur en arrière-plan */
        .bg-glow {
            position: absolute;
            top: -100px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 600px;
            height: 300px;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
            filter: blur(120px);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        header {
            padding: 25px 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa, #7c3aed);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .main-container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        h1 span {
            color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        p {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 18px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .buttons-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 650;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9);
            color: white;
            border: none;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        footer {
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="bg-glow"></div>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">NewStreet RP</div>
    </header>

    <div class="main-container">
        <h1>Bienvenue sur <span>NewStreet</span></h1>
        <p>Plonge dans une expérience de jeu unique. Rejoins notre communauté, découvre nos nouveautés et lance ton aventure dès maintenant.</p>
        
        <div class="buttons-group">
            <a href="/recrutement" class="btn btn-primary">Accéder aux recrutements</a>
            <a href="https://discord.gg/ton-lien-discord" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">Rejoindre le Discord</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 NewStreet Roleplay. Tous droits réservés.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
